{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le04ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le04ob07re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn10le04ob07re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn10le04ob07re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hi. I'm here to register for my classes.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Registrar</span>: First you must present three pieces of ID and a document from your last school, as well as your student number.", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn10le04ob07re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Which document?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Registrar</span>: I'm referring to the transcript from your last school.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Okay. Do I have to have proof of address?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Registrar</span>: No. These are fine. Okay, so which courses have you selected in your program?", "id": 2, "time": "10500"}, {"image": "engenn10le04ob07re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I have selected the three core courses that I have to take, but not the electives. To be honest I'm not sure if I should choose Food and Beverage Management because I took something similar at Culinary school .<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Registrar</span>: If you take Food and Beverage you'll learn a lot about budgeting, specifically for smaller restaurants.", "id": 3, "time": "25000"}, {"image": "engenn10le04ob07re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It seems to me that would be beneficial. I'll sign up for that elective and the one called Advanced Wine Studies and Management before they are full.", "id": 4, "time": "45000"}, {"image": "engenn10le04ob07re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Registrar</span>: Okay,  I must inform you that, as of today, if you drop or withdraw from that course in particular, you won't receive a refund. When you commit to that course, it's permanent, because it is so popular and limited to a small number of students. As soon as you are enrolled in all five courses, you will receive confirmation via email.", "id": 5, "time": "55000"}, {"image": "engenn10le04ob07re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: In case I forget, will you tell me which courses have the biggest work load?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Registrar</span>: Yes. If you ask me, Management and Food operations seems the heaviest. By that I mean that there are numerous reports, essays and seminars. Many students have found it difficult to take a full course load when that course is part of it. You have to keep on top of your assignments and you must not get behind. Well, you're all set! Before you leave please use the computer in the foyer and enter your student number to activate enrollment.", "id": 6, "time": "74000"}]}}], "_data": []}], "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about education and character traits.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can express what is and isn't necessary in the present and in the past.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can clarify my opinion. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What do you know about the practice of meditation? Would you try it or recommend it?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What other things can you do to feel more relaxed?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct